ery-factory/scripts[dev,ml,host]" 39	``` 40	 41	External binaries (needed only for the closing true-compute endorsement; 42	each runner locates the executable via `PATH`): 43	 44	| Binary | Purpose | Source | 45	|---|---|---| 46	| xtb | Semi-empirical quantum single points (funnel pre-screen) | [github.com/grimme-lab/xtb/releases](https://github.com/grimme-lab/xtb/releases) | 47	| ORCA | True DFT endorsement (Top-3) | [faccts.de/orca](https://www.faccts.de/orca/) (academic license) | 48	| GROMACS | True MD endorsement (Top-1) | [gromacs.org/Downloads](https://www.gromacs.org/Downloads) | 49	 50	ML potentials (MACE-MP/CHGNet) ship with the `[ml]` extra. Cases with 51	`real_compute: false` need none of the above. 52	 53	### Environment bootstrap (no secrets on disk) 54	 55	Create `.env` in the repo root before running: 56	`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=<your key>`. `run.py` resolves configuration in order 57	(existing environment variables always win): 58	 59	| Variable | Default | Meaning | 60	|---|---|---| 61	| `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` | `https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic` | Anthropic-compatible endpoint | 62	| `ANTHROPIC_MODEL` | `deepseek-v4-pro` | Model name | 63	| `ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN` | `.env`'s `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` | Credential; skipped if an Anthropic token is already set | 64	 65	Secrets are injected only into child-process environment variables, never 66	written to files, never printed. Connectivity smoke test: 67	`.venv\Scripts\python.exe run.py --smoke-test`. 68	 69	## Running 70	 71	**The user's only input is natural language** --- no YAML is ever written or 72	read by hand. State the design objective directly (e.g., "design a battery 73	with energy density ≥ 400 Wh/kg and 4C fast charge without lithium 74	plating"): 75	 76	1. The skill clarifies item by item via AskUserQuestion (objective 77	   quantification / starting stage / system / ablation / true-compute 78	   switch --- all with defaults). 79	2. After clarification the skill records the criteria, writes them into